    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join us for our&nbsp;beloved&nbsp;samba gathering at Lula Lounge! Terreiro do Samba brings people together to celebrate Brazilian music, dance, and community. This month, we welcome back  Carlos Cardozo , joined by special guest Ana Aune and band members Andre Valério, Baiano, and Cristiano"
