      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Spiritual World, Higher Heights Hi-Fi, Bless Up Sound System, Tubby Roots Sound, Uma Nota Culture and Pressure Drop present legendary London, UK, Sound System Jah Tubbys and MC Macky Banton.  Custom sound system, five crews, MC Rankin Steppa, Selectress Jeany Roots and Sista Mary.  Jah Tubbys was es"
