    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "For the first time ever, renowned singer  Marcelo Falcão  arrives in Canada for a unique tour. On this special night, Falcão will showcase songs from his latest album, as well as iconic hits from his time with Rappa.   Tickets available now .  Presented by Uma Nota Culture &amp; Showzaço."
