      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Uma Nota New Year - dance into 2024 with us!   Come celebrate the changing of the year Uma Nota style at our favourite cozy and sweaty west-end dance floor locale,  BSMT 254  at 9pm.  With DJs   Me Time  ,   Sikh Knowledge  ,   Juana Go-gó  , and Vas  PLUS a rare live indoor  Maracatu  to count us i"
      }
