    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Let's end the year on a high note at the last Terreiro do Samba of 2023! Call your friends and family to come party at Lula Lounge on Sunday, December 17th, at 6 pm. Enjoy the best of Samba with this dream team: Alfredo Alves, Andre Valeiro, Carlinhos Cardoso, and Ian Felix. With special guest appea"
