        "@value": "On the \"Day of the Creole Song\" in Perú, we commemorate, with music, dance and food, the long cultural merging of three cultures. The encounter of European, African, and Native traditions on the coast of our corner of South America gave the ingredients for the mixture that is our heritage."
      }
    ],
