      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Uma Nota Culture and Nomada Project are thrilled to present the incredible Indus!  Coming all the way from Colombia to share in a special night of music.  Indus is a folk - electronic duo, formed by Caribbean coast born Oscar Alford and Andres Mercado aka Doc Keyta. Their unique sound portrays afro-"
