        "@value": "Let’s celebrate the first Terreiro do Samba of 2023 with a special party for carnival!  Bring your friends and family to Lula Lounge Sunday, Feb 26th at 6 pm.  The best of Samba with our beloved Roda de Samba de Toronto, and, direct from Montreal, Flavia Nascimento!  Don't miss it!  Tickets are gene"
