        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "#TerreirodoSamba    Let’s celebrate the last Terreiro do Samba of 2022! (But don't worry we'll be back in 2023!)  Bring your friends and family to Lula Lounge Sunday, Dec 18th at 6 pm.  The best of Samba with our beloved Aline Morales, Zeca Polina, Samyle Carvalho, Debora Souto, Baiano, Pedro Joel a"
